;\">Spend $250, receive a $25 voucher</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Spend $500, receive a $65 voucher</span><br><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Spend $1000, receive a $150 voucher</span><br><br><span style=\"color:#110011;font-size:12px;\">The voucher promotion applies to eligible customers who make a qualifying purchase between May 9 and May 11, 2025. Vouchers are valid for online purchases and in-store at our Brooklyn location from June 1 through June 30, 2025, until 11:59 PM ET. Qualified customers will receive an email confirmation within two weeks, plus a reminder and redemption instructions when the period begins. Voucher is valid for one-time use per customer, up to $150. It may not be combined with other discounts, redeemed for cash or credit, or used toward gift card purchases. In the event of a return, voucher credit will not be reissued or refunded. Voucher must be used in full in a single transaction during the redemption window; unused balances will be forfeited. No adjustments on prior purchases. Exclusions include gift cards, select styles, Yarn and yarn services, Made-to-Order items, and products categorized as Limited.&nbsp;</span></p><p><br><span style=\"color:#110011;font-size:12px;\">Misha &amp; Puff reserves the right to modify or cancel these promotions at any time.</span></p>"}],
